WEBVTT

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.500
Machigacchai nai kara
It's not wrong

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.960
Kyou norikitta ippo wa
So that one step you took and endured today is

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:08.830
Sanzen to kagayaku ashioto nanda
The sound of a footstep that radiates brilliantly

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.250
Machigacchai nai kara
It's not wrong

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:19.920
Muchuu de tobikonda sekai wa seikai da
So the world you blindly jumped into must be right

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.880
Yokubari datta anokoro egaiteita miraizu wa 
The plans I held for the future when I was greedy

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.130
Ahiru no Sora

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:30.130
Kikubari no mainichi de yogoretetta 
Was soiled by my days of attentiveness to others

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.540
Onaji yume mita yatsura wa tokku ni 
Those that sought the same dream have long ago

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.790
Atarashii michi o aruiteru
Started on new paths

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:44.250
Tameiki wa sora o nibiiro ni someru 
Sighs color the sky a dark gray

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.380
Dakedo mada owari janai 
But it's not the end yet

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:57.960
Ashita koso wa to negai utau 
Today must be the day, so I pray as I sing

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.460
Machigacchai nai kara
It's not wrong

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.630
Kyou norikitta ippo wa
So that one step you took and endured today is

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:11.710
Sanzen to kagayaku ashioto nanda
The sound of a footstep that radiates brilliantly

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.880
Machigacchai nai kara
It's not wrong

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:22.500
Muchuu de tobikonda sekai wa seikai da
The world you blindly jumped into must be right

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.670
What Must Be Protected

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.750
Tsutaetai anata e 
I want to convey them to you

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:07.420
Sarakedasu omoi o
Lay all of my feelings bare

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:13.960
Uso demo tsumi demo waratteite hoshikute
Whether I have to lie or sin, I just want you to smile

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:16.920
Anata ga kureta kono tsubasa de
By using these wings that you gave me

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:19.880
Tsunagu "yakusoku" o dakishimete
And embracing the "promise" that ties us together

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:23.710
Sora e nobase yo!
I'll stretch up to the sky!

00:22:23.710 --> 00:22:26.630
Tada hikari sasu hou e 
Towards where only light shines

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:32.290
Iki o koroshite itanda 
I was suffocating myself

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:38.130
Kago no naka no katasumi de 
In the empty corner of a cage

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:39.880
Aa... maru de
Yeah... it was as if

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:43.330
"Habatakenai tori no you da" 
"I'm just like a bird that can't fly"

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:49.170
Iiwake bakari tozashite shimai sou de
I nearly locked myself in with all the excuses

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:51.250
Kawaritai 
I want to change

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:52.790
Kawarenai 
I cannot change

00:22:52.790 --> 00:22:55.580
Uso ni mamiretemo
Even if I become stained in lies

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:56.960
Kowaretai
I want to fall apart

00:22:56.960 --> 00:22:58.170
Kowasanai 
I cannot fall apart

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:00.580
Ima... tobidase
Now... I set flight

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:03.960
Oozora e hirogeta
Sailing into the open sky

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:06.630
Minikui tsubasa de
On these ugly wings

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:13.330
Mou nitodo to itami o kurikaesanai you ni 
To assure I never go through the same pain again

00:23:13.630 --> 00:23:16.210
Konna ni mo moroku hakanakute
Still so very fragile and ephemeral

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:19.080
Donna ni mo kegare buzama demo 
But no matter how dirty or pathetic

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:22.920
Agake! Agareyo!
I'll fight! I'll rise!

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:26.540
Wazukani kagayaku hou e
Towards where there is a tiny glimmer

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:35.420
Ahiru no Sora
